WEBVTT

00:00:01.080 --> 00:00:05.080
Hi, I'm Sia, your coach for Certified Contact Centre Excellence.

00:00:06.560 --> 00:00:09.060
Here's how to get the most out of our time together.

00:00:10.060 --> 00:00:14.080
On every page, I'll talk you through what's in front of you and point

00:00:14.100 --> 00:00:15.120
things out as I go.

00:00:16.180 --> 00:00:17.140
You're in charge.

00:00:17.760 --> 00:00:22.760
Pause me, skip ahead, replay a page, or choose I'll read.

00:00:23.800 --> 00:00:24.600
Stuck?

00:00:24.740 --> 00:00:27.180
Tap the talk button and ask me anything.

00:00:27.700 --> 00:00:28.740
I'll answer out loud.

00:00:29.720 --> 00:00:32.439
Highlight anything and add your own notes.

00:00:33.020 --> 00:00:34.400
Only you can see them.

00:00:35.440 --> 00:00:39.100
Some questions you'll click and you'll need them right to move on.

00:00:40.120 --> 00:00:43.940
Others, I'll ask out loud, so allow your microphone.

00:00:45.020 --> 00:00:47.100
Each module ends with a practice call.

00:00:48.000 --> 00:00:51.400
Score 80% or more on each one and you're certified.

00:00:52.280 --> 00:00:53.240
Let's get started.
